  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Install:</strong> Hospital<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb<br>\n<strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)</p>\n<p>Paired Cyberarms with 2 option slots. When a user that has moved at least<br>\n4 m/yds this Turn makes a Brawling or Martial Arts<br>\nAttack against cover (and only cover) using their arms,<br>\nthe damage of their Attack is increased by 3d6. When used in conjunction with the Rocklin Augmentics Skydrivers, grants the user +1 to Brawling checks.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Cyberarm (Foundational)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> provides 2</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>One item is the pair of arms: install it once. Its 2 slots are the 2 option slots of each arm, so a paired option uses one of them.</li>\n<li>The +1 to Brawling with Rocklin Augmentics Skydrivers (a Corgo's 77 cyberleg alternative) is a toggle in the roll dialog. The +3d6 against cover is not automated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Cyberware).</em></p>"
